                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 227.5, 17.0, 126.0, 21.0 ],
                                    "text": "Tap tempo subpatcher"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "background": 1,
                                    "bubble": 1,
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontsize": 10.0,
                                    "id": "obj-76",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 340.0, 40.0, 130.0, 34.0 ],
                                    "saved_attribute_attributes": {
                                        "bubble_bgcolor": {
                                            "expression": "themecolor.theme_locked_bgcolor"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "text": "Double-click to see the embedded patches",
                                    "textjustification": 1
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "background": 1,
                                    "fontface": 1,
                                    "id": "obj-75",
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 690.0, 100.0, 70.0, 21.0 ],
                                    "text": "Description"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "background": 1,
                                    "id": "obj-68",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 163.0, 394.0, 70.0, 35.0 ],
                                    "text": "Smoothen modulation"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "background": 1,
                                    "id": "obj-74",
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 370.0, 97.0, 77.0, 21.0 ],
                                    "text": "External LFO"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "background": 1,
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "id": "obj-71",
                                    "linecount": 9,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 690.0, 620.0, 230.0, 136.0 ],
                                    "text": "Finally input and modulated signals are  mixed (added) together to obtain the chorusing effect. Additionally, a slight amplitude attenuation that dynamically increases accordingly to the value of Depth, is applied to the output signals. This avoids producing amplitude peaks when two identical signals are mixed, i.e. when Depth is close to 0 (no effect)."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "background": 1,
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "id": "obj-42",
                                    "linecount": 8,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 690.0, 400.0, 223.0, 122.0 ],
                                    "text": "The range of delay modulation is controlled by the Depth parameter. \nThe value of Depth is used to transform the range of the triangular modulation into a delay time modulation. The modulation is then smoothened and translated to samples before feeding the delay~ object."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "background": 1,
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "id": "obj-59",
                                    "linecount": 7,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 690.0, 290.0, 220.0, 107.0 ],
                                    "text": "To obtain stereo modulation, we’re shifting the input phase of the triangle~ object whose waveform is used to control the delay of the right audio channel. The phase offset between L and R modulation waveforms is controlled by the Spread parameter."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "background": 1,
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "id": "obj-67",
                                    "linecount": 3,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 690.0, 230.0, 210.0, 50.0 ],
                                    "text": "The triangular waveform is then used to increase and decrease the amount of delay applied to the input signal. "
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "background": 1,
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "id": "obj-69",
                                    "linecount": 7,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 690.0, 120.0, 221.0, 107.0 ],
                                    "text": "The phasor~ object inside the LFO~ subpatcher generates a signal ramp, at a rate controlled by the Rate parameter. The rate can be set by tempo tapping. The ramp is used as a phase value (x) to read in a triangular wavetable stored in the triangle~ object (y). "
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "background": 1,
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontname": "Lato Bold",
                                    "fontsize": 18.0,
                                    "id": "obj-96",
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 690.0, 35.0, 122.0, 28.0 ],
                                    "text": "RNBO Chorus"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "background": 1,
                                    "fontface": 1,
                                    "id": "obj-28",
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 690.0, 60.0, 155.0, 21.0 ],
                                    "text": "Classic stereo chorus effect"
                                }
